{
  "title": "Object / File / Block · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "데이터를 다루는 세 가지 기본 형태다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Object / File / Block</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#comparison\">비교표</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#object-storage\">Object Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">File Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#block-storage\">Block Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#instance-store\">Instance Store</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#durability-and-availability\">Durability and Availability</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#iops-throughput-and-latency\">IOPS, Throughput and Latency</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>스토리지</span><span>35 / 62</span></div><h1>Object / File / Block</h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 6 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>Storage 선택은 데이터 크기보다 애플리케이션이 데이터를 읽고 쓰는 인터페이스에서 시작한다. Object, File, Block은 같은 데이터라도 접근 단위와 공유 방식이 서로 다르다.</p><p>내구성, 지연, 처리량, 동시 접근, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 범위와 운영 부담을 다음으로 비교한다. Object를 File처럼 보이게 하는 도구가 있어도 원래 서비스의 동작·제약까지 같아지는 것은 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"Storage Interface 선택\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>Storage Interface 선택</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>API access</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#buckets-objects-and-keys\">Object Key</a></strong><small>HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span>·SDK로 접근</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></strong><small><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#object-storage\">Object Storage</a></small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Images / Logs / Backup</strong><small><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#buckets-objects-and-keys\">Bucket</a>·Lifecycle 관리</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>OS access</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Shared path or disk?</strong><small>앱의 File System 요구</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/\">EFS</a> / <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/\">FSx</a> or <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a></strong><small>File 공유 또는 Block Volume</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Protocol / <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> check</strong><small><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">NFS</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">SMB</a>·같은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 연결 조건</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\">File 공유와 여러 Host가 같은 Block Device에 동시에 쓰는 것은 다른 문제다.</p></div></figure></section><section id=\"comparison\" class=\"wiki-section\"><h2>비교표</h2><div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"비교표\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Model</th><th scope=\"col\">Interface</th><th scope=\"col\">Typical service</th><th scope=\"col\">Sharing</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Object</td><td>Object API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> / Key</td><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></td><td>API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> 기반 다중 Client</td></tr><tr><td>File</td><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">NFS</a> / <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">SMB</a> / File path</td><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/\">EFS</a> / <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/\">FSx</a></td><td>File System 동시 공유</td></tr><tr><td>Block</td><td>Disk block</td><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a></td><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 내 Instance 연결</td></tr><tr><td>Temporary block</td><td>Local disk</td><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#instance-store\">Instance Store</a></td><td>Host 생명주기에 종속</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"object-storage\"><h2>Object Storage<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#object-storage\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Object는 데이터와 Metadata를 Key로 식별하며 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span>로 읽고 쓴다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#buckets-objects-and-keys\">Bucket</a> 안의 Object를 저장하며 이미지·로그·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">백업</a>·Data Lake에 적합하다. 파일 일부의 임의 Block을 디스크처럼 수정하는 인터페이스와는 다르다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"file-storage\"><h2>File Storage<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Directory와 File 경로를 사용하고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">NFS</a> 또는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">SMB</a> 같은 프로토콜로 접근한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/\">EFS</a>와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/\">FSx</a>는 여러 Compute가 공유 파일을 사용하는 요구를 다룬다. Protocol, File Lock, OS와 Identity 통합을 확인해야 기존 애플리케이션을 그대로 옮길 수 있다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"block-storage\"><h2>Block Storage<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#block-storage\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>OS가 볼륨의 Block을 읽고 쓰며 그 위에 File System 또는 Database를 구성한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>의 Boot Volume과 낮은 지연의 영구 디스크에 사용한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a> Volume은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>에 속하고 일반적인 연결은 공유 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">NFS</a> 서비스와 다르다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"instance-store\"><h2>Instance Store<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#instance-store\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Instance Host에 물리적으로 연결된 임시 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#block-storage\">Block Storage</a>다. 빠른 Scratch·Cache에 적합하지만 Stop·Terminate 또는 Host 장애 뒤 데이터 보존을 기대하지 않는다. 필요한 데이터는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a> 등 영구 저장소에 복제한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"durability-and-availability\"><h2>Durability and Availability<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#durability-and-availability\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Durability는 데이터 자체의 손실 가능성, Availability는 필요할 때 접근 가능한 정도다. 단일 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 저장도 높은 내구성을 제공할 수 있지만 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 장애 시 접근 중단 위험은 별개다. 서비스별 복제 범위와 Backup을 함께 비교한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"iops-throughput-and-latency\"><h2>IOPS <span class=\"full-name\">(Input/Output Operations per Second)</span>, Throughput and Latency<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#iops-throughput-and-latency\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#iops-throughput-and-latency\">IOPS</a>는 초당 I/O <span class=\"full-name\">(Input/Output)</span> 수, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#iops-throughput-and-latency\">Throughput</a>은 초당 데이터량, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#iops-throughput-and-latency\">Latency</a>는 한 요청의 응답 시간이다. 작은 Random I/O <span class=\"full-name\">(Input/Output)</span> Database와 큰 Sequential File 처리의 병목은 다르다. Storage뿐 아니라 Instance의 Network·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a> 대역폭도 제한이 된다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>웹 이미지 배포는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>, 여러 Linux 서버의 공통 업로드 Directory는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/\">EFS</a>, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>에 설치한 DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span>의 Disk는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a>를 먼저 비교한다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 버킷은 운영 체제에 바로 붙는 일반 블록 디스크가 아니다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/whitepapers/latest/aws-overview/storage-services.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">whitepapers/latest/aws-overview/storage-services.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q039/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q039\" data-question=\"Q039\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q039</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q039/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An EC2 instance needs an operating-system-visible volume for database files. What type of storage is required?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q039\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Block storage</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q039\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Object storage</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q039\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">DNS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q039\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Publish/subscribe messaging</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a> 같은 블록 장치가 파일 시스템을 생성해 사용하는 볼륨이다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/\">Object / File / Block</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q040\" data-question=\"Q040\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q040</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q040/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A web application stores image files by key and serves them over HTTP. Which service should it consider first?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q040\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A single EBS volume</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q040\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An ENI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q040\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon S3</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q040\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A network ACL</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>는 객체 저장과 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> 접근에 적합하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/\">Object / File / Block</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q047\" data-question=\"Q047\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q047</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q047/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Linux EC2 instances in multiple AZs must share the same files through a POSIX/NFS interface. Which service should be considered?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q047\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Glacier Deep Archive</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q047\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Each instance&#x27;s local instance store</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q047\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Regional Amazon EFS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q047\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">One EBS volume directly attached across AZs</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a>형 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/\">EFS</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>별 마운트 대상을 통해 여러 Linux 자원에서 공유할 수 있다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/\">EFS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/\">Object / File / Block</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q086\" data-question=\"Q086\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0,4\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q086</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q086/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An on-premises Windows file application must retain an SMB interface while storing data in AWS. Which TWO services are candidates?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q086\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon FSx for Windows File Server</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q086\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Only Amazon EFS over NFS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q086\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS snapshot as a file share</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q086\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Only Route 53 Resolver</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q086\" value=\"4\"><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 File Gateway</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, E</strong> · 관리형 Windows 파일 시스템에는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/\">FSx</a>, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 객체로 이어지는 하이브리드 파일 인터페이스에는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/\">File Gateway</a>가 맞는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/\">FSx</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/\">Storage Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/\">Object / File / Block</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q049\" data-question=\"Q049\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q049</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q049/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An on-premises application expects an SMB file share, while new files must be stored as objects in S3. Which service is appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q049\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon Route 53</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q049\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An RDS read replica</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q049\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 File Gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q049\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">EBS gp3</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/\">File Gateway</a>가 온프레미스 파일 인터페이스와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 객체 저장을 연결한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/\">Storage Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/\">FSx</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/\">이전 용어 <b>Network ACL</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/\">다음 용어 <b>Placement Group</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
